ase tracking-wider\">\r\n1115:                         Escáner Biométrico de Huella\r\n1116:                       </p>\r\n1117:                       <span className={`text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ${\r\n1118:                         newClientFingerprintEnrolled\r\n1119:                           ? 'bg-emerald-500 text-white font-black shadow-glow-green'\r\n1120:                           : 'bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40'\r\n1121:                       }`}>\r\n1122:                         {newClientFingerprintEnrolled ? '✓ Enrolada' : 'Pendiente'}\r\n1123:                       </span>\r\n1124:                     </div>\r\n1125:                     <p className=\"text-[11px] text-gray-300 mt-0.5\">\r\n1126:                       {newClientFingerprintEnrolled \r\n1127:                         ? `✓ Huella vinculada (${selectedFinger}) • Clic para ver escáner / re-escanear` \r\n1128:                         : 'Haz clic aquí para abrir el dashboard y registrar tu huella en grande'}\r\n1129:                     </p>\r\n1130:                   </div>\r\n1131:                 </div>\r\n1132:                 <button\r\n1133:                   type=\"button\"\r\n1134:                   onClick={(e) => {\r\n1135:                     e.stopPropagation();\r\n1136:                     setBiometricScanState('idle');\r\n1137:                     setShowBiometricDashboard(true);\r\n1138:                   }}\r\n1139:                   className={`px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-black transition-all transform group-hover:scale-105 shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\r\n1140:                     newClientFingerprintEnrolled \r\n1141:                       ? 'bg-emerald-500 text-white font-black shadow-glow-green' \r\n1142:                       : 'bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-white font-black shadow-glow-gold'\r\n1143:                   }`}\r\n1144:                 >\r\n1145:                   {newClientFinger